projects. Each is distributed under the MIT License. The pinned upstream commits
are recorded in rust/crates/runtime/bundled-skills/SOURCES.json, and the full
license texts are kept in rust/crates/runtime/bundled-skills/licenses/ and are
embedded in the binary next to the skills. Neuron adds host-adapter sections to
some of these skills; those additions are not part of the upstream projects.

